# Tier-1 test corpus -- the private ROMs the automated suite actually asks for.
#
# NOT a curated wishlist: every pattern set below is copied from a real
# scripts/find-rom.sh call in the Makefile or in test/tools/*.sh, so this file
# and the suite cannot drift into disagreeing about what "enough ROMs" means.
# Adding a title here without a test that requests it just grows the download.
#
# Format:  one entry per line, patterns separated by '|', tried in order
#          (same semantics as find-rom.sh arguments).
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Regenerate the manifest after editing:  make roms-manifest
Iron Soldier (1994).jag|Iron Soldier (World)*.j64|Iron Soldier.jag
Iron Soldier 2 (World).j64|Iron Soldier 2*.j64|Iron Soldier 2*.jag
Super Burnout (1995).jag|Super Burnout*.jag|Super Burnout*.j64
Atari Karts (1995).jag|Atari Karts*.jag|Atari Karts*.j64
Skyhammer_(1999).jag|*skyhammer*.jag|*skyhammer*.j64|*skyhammer*.rom
Doom - Evil Unleashed (1994).jag|Doom (World)*.j64|Doom.jag
Alien vs Predator (1994).jag|*Alien*Predator*.jag|*Alien*Predator*.j64
BALLOONS.BIN|Balloons*.bin|Balloon*.bin
*BIOS* Atari Jaguar (World).j64
